Ghostty Configurator — Third-Party Notices
===========================================

This project is an unofficial, community-built visual configurator for the
Ghostty terminal. It is NOT affiliated with or endorsed by the Ghostty project.

1. Dock icon artwork
--------------------
The nine macOS Dock icon previews (official, blueprint, chalkboard, glass,
holographic, microchip, paper, retro, xray) are artwork owned by the Ghostty
project (https://github.com/ghostty-org/ghostty). They are embedded here at a
reduced resolution solely to let users preview Ghostty's built-in `macos-icon`
options before choosing one. All rights to this artwork remain with the Ghostty
project. If the Ghostty maintainers request removal, the images will be replaced
with placeholders.

2. Terminal color schemes
-------------------------
The 463 bundled color themes are the palettes shipped with Ghostty, which in
turn largely derive from the iTerm2-Color-Schemes project
(https://github.com/mbadolato/iTerm2-Color-Schemes), licensed under MIT.
Only numeric color values are reproduced.

